    <div class="lease-guide-hero">
      <div class="lease-guide-hero__content">
        <div class="eyebrow">Tenant Guide</div>
        <h1>The Ultimate Guide to Leasing Commercial Space</h1>
        <p class="lead">A practical guide to finding, evaluating, and negotiating the right space for your business.</p>
        <p>
          Leasing commercial space can feel overwhelming. There are unfamiliar terms, long contracts, and decisions that can affect your business for years. Most people go through this process only a few times, so it is hard to know what actually matters.
        </p>
        <p>
          This guide is meant to simplify things. Whether you are opening your first location or relocating an existing business, it will walk you through how the process works, what to look for, how pricing really works, and what to watch out for before you sign anything.
        </p>
        <div class="button-row">
          <a class="btn-primary" href="#lease-guide-contact">Get help finding space</a>
          <a class="btn-secondary" href="#guide-sections">Jump to guide sections</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="lease-guide-hero__card">
        <div class="eyebrow">What this guide covers</div>
        <ul class="lease-guide-checklist">
          <li>How the leasing process works</li>
          <li>How to compare locations and buildings</li>
          <li>How pricing and lease structures work</li>
          <li>How brokers, lawyers, and planners can help</li>
          <li>How to avoid common tenant mistakes</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>

